local.description:
Retain explicit specialist observations and criterion judgments for a saved candidate or family. Derive evidence bindings; optionally nominate or complete through existing checks. Retry the identical review ID/payload with current state_hash after interruption. No provider action or automatic visual judgment. Optional result_path saves the exact full JSON under a fresh project-relative path and returns a compact path/hash summary.

All tools are local. PixelLab must be connected separately. Paths are relative to the configured project root.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__pixl_local__pixl_candidate_review(args: {
  candidate_id: string;
  // Current canonical production state hash from pixl_validate.hash or pixl_review_context.state_hash; not a PLAR/file/binding hash.
  expect: string;
  observation: { action: "record" | "nominate" | "complete"; binding_hash: string; limitations: Array<string>; next_action: string; observations: Array<{ mode: "local" | "visual" | "live"; note: string; path: string; sha256: string; }>; observed_at: string; reviewer: string; verdicts: Array<{ criterion: string; observations: Array<number>; reason: string; status: "pass" | "fail" | "unavailable"; supersedes: string | null; }>; version: 1; };
  result_path?: string;
  review_id: string;
  store: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

